    {
      "name": "skill_get",
      "title": "Skill Get",
      "description": "Load the FULL body (the step-by-step procedure) of a known skill.\n\nWHEN: the skills index lists a procedure that fits the task but whose body was\nNOT auto-injected (only the top matches are detailed). Call this to fetch the\nexact steps BEFORE acting \u2014 do not reconstruct the procedure from memory.\n\nResolves over the skills visible to you (your personal skills + the curated\nglobal library; the per-user precedence applies). Returns an error if no skill\nmatches the given name.\n\nSkills live in a protected store OUTSIDE the /work sandbox (a `skills/`\nfolder seen in the sandbox is only a disposable mirror \u2014 do not edit it): to\nREAD a bundled reference/script use skill_read_file(name, path); to RUN a\nbundled script use skill_run_script(name, script).",
      "inputSchema": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "name": {
            "description": "The skill name exactly as it appears in the skills index (e.g. 'jenkins-deploy').",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "name"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
